Report drift between the workspace and manovaspace/ci/ci/versions.env, resolved dependency versions, kit exports shadowed by local code, agent configuration, repositories without tests, upstream toolchain lag and merge-gate bypasses. The audit is read-only: it never edits a repository and reads the network only with --remote on the checks that support it. Exit codes: 0 no ERROR findings, 1 at least one ERROR, 2 something could not be verified.

Usage:
  orbit audit [flags]
  orbit audit [command]

Available Commands:
  agents      Check handbook gates, editor configuration and agent runtimes
  deps        Report resolved dependency versions, forbidden ranges and shadowed exports
  merges      Report merged pull requests that bypassed the merge gate
  tests       Report repositories with no tests and GitHub Actions usage
  upstream    Report OSV advisories and toolchain versions behind upstream
  usage       Verify kit imports against the installed package exports
  versions    Compare tool versions with manovaspace/ci/ci/versions.env

Flags:
  -h, --help     help for audit
      --json     Print the report as a JSON envelope
      --remote   Also run the network checks (registry, OSV, releases, merges, Actions billing)

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit audit [command] --help" for more information about a command.
